  "A classmate shares an answer that is different from yours.": ["Saying “You're wrong!” loudly can embarrass your classmate.","Laughing at them can hurt their feelings.","Rolling your eyes is rude and can hurt feelings."],
  "You see a classmate copying your test.": ["Letting them copy isn't fair, and they won't learn.","Copying theirs back is cheating too.","Shouting during the test disturbs everyone."],
